window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Konnor McAiden meets a street tough psychiatrist Mallorie Mylard on the crowded streets of New York City the same day he loses his job. She sees through his dumb country boy act and for the first time in a long time they decide to take a chance. As their chance meeting turns into so much more caught up in the mysteries and dangers each other hold they decide to take a trip to Konnor's home town and discover the monsters they find are far worse than the ones they were trying to leave behind. Logic will be challenged and the ties of love, family and honor will be tried and tested.</p>"; 
